&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-920483-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Involuntary smooth muscle contractions that propel food through the oesophagus and intestines.&lt;/div&gt;
