&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-765825-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. For some pictures of said girls, please see the &#039;Cool Stuff!&#039; part of the page.&lt;/div&gt;
