					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>Greetings, fellow humans!</span></h1> </div> <p>If by any chance you clicked the link to this page, it probably means you read one of my articles. How about you learn who I am then? I'm <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>, an amateur writer on the SCP Wiki.</p> <p>I'm a very proud owner of two of the bestest girls, Fiffy and Franny<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup> (of Fifka and Franka, as dog names don't translate well), a giant science-nerd, and an unhealthy fan of Queen and David Bowie.</p> <p>I write a thing or two once in a while, and hopefully some day I will actually get to those three articles!</p> <p>Wait, you're telling me that already happened? Huh, time flies by quickly. Anyways, welcome to my authorpage then!</p> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Attendance.png" alt="Attendance.png" class="image" /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Arrows.png" alt="Arrows.png" class="image" /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Scream.jpg" alt="Scream.jpg" class="image" /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/TV.png" alt="TV.png" class="image" /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Cycle.jpg" alt="Cycle.jpg" class="image" /> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Apple.png" alt="Apple.png" class="image" /><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></div> <hr /> <div id="wiki-tabview-7f2410dbcf18093e10a4f3c4d7f9bff9" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Tales</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>GoI Formats</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Other Stuff</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This is easily the dumbest thing I have so far written<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup>. It started off as an inside joke between <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5884163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Jakob17" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5884163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakob17" >Jakob17</a></span>, and myself on the SCPD Discord Server, and whilst the stupidity of it was beyond anything I've ever read, I genuinely couldn't resist the urge to write it. The article blew up into +40 within the first day, being my first thing to get into the &quot;big numbers&quot;.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>A rewrite of my first proper SCP ever, SCP-5555-EX. I wrote 0000-EX in approximately one day upon being hit with inspiration for a rewrite I've been meaning to do for a long time. Though I'm pretty happy with how this article has turned out, I am probably going to rewrite it for a third time. We'll see.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>The first installment of the Ontokinetics Saga. I started writing this after me and my mother were riding through a section of our town that was totally abandoned - the buildings were almost intact, yet not a single human being could be found there. Additionally, the whole place was covered in fog, which only added to the already existing spookiness of it. My imagination did the rest of course, with me quickly tying the idea to an overarching narrative I had in my mind for quite some time, and thus SCP-5936 was born.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Whilst before The Watchman I did attempt to write an article once<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-5" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >5</a></sup>, this was my first successful one. As I had no idea what I was doing back in the day, I coldposted it, and surprisingly enough, it survived, and currently sits at a pretty nice number of upvotes. The whole idea and layout for the article pretty much popped into my mind during a walk near a sea and I wrote the whole thing in approximately 30 minutes. It's still, to this day, one of my favorite works of mine.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>The second installment in my short 'series' centered around the world of the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/revised-entry">Revised Entry</a> of SCP-173. Though looking back, it's pretty mediocre, I still like it quite the bit - especially considering that this was the first article my author avatar, Daniel Asheworth, appeared in.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p>Nothing here! Yet!</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Author&nbsp;commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>This happened faster than I expected, but hey, it's pretty cool to have one of these. If you found this, then thank you so much for reading, and I'll see you in the next article!</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tabview-3f7cdd7aa1e19dad7cbca0690ff0e879" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Serious stuff.</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Cool Stuff!</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>What do other users think about Ralliston?</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p>Hopefully this tab will never be needed, but life is life. If no one can contact me<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-6" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >6</a></sup> or cannot find any information regarding my whereabouts for over 2 years, I would like for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span>, to take full control of all of my articles, except for collaborations, which go to their respective co-authors.</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Doggos!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Doggos!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/Fifka"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/Fifka/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="Fifka" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>:D</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/Fifka2"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/Fifka2/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="Fifka2" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>more doggo :3</p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/Franka"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/Franka/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="Franka" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>:p</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/Franka2"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/Franka2/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="Franka2" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>even more doggo :}</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Fanart!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;The&nbsp;fact&nbsp;that&nbsp;people&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;draw&nbsp;my&nbsp;stuff&nbsp;feels&nbsp;like&nbsp;a&nbsp;fever&nbsp;dream</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/asheworth2"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/asheworth2/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="asheworth2" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>Dr. Asheworth by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252186&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Dr Whitney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252186)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" >Dr Whitney</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/asheworth"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/asheworth/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="asheworth" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>Dr. Asheworth by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6501232&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Trymeline" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6501232)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" >Trymeline</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/jon"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/jon/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="jon" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p>Jon Coderoy from <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/the-watchman">The Watchamn</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-tyrant" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4673117&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Dr_Tyrant" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4673117)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-tyrant" >Dr_Tyrant</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:250px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/ralliston-s-authorpage/bear"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/bear/medium.jpg" style="width:250px;" alt="bear" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:250px;"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rafrusalka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6958540&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="RafRusalka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6958540)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rafrusalka" >RafRusalka</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Translations!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;The&nbsp;fact&nbsp;that&nbsp;people&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;translate&nbsp;my&nbsp;stuff&nbsp;feels&nbsp;like&nbsp;even&nbsp;a&nbsp;larger&nbsp;fever&nbsp;dream</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-watchman">The Watchman</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-overseer">The Overseer</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:lolfoundation">The lolFoundation Theme</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Chinese Wiki Branch</li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.net.pl/scp-5464">SCP-5464</a></strong> - on the Polish Wiki Branch</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;What's&nbsp;up&nbsp;with&nbsp;those&nbsp;small&nbsp;images&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;page?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>These are <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-achievement-badges">SCP Achievement Badges</a>, a cool little system made for fun by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="RJB_R" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r" >RJB_R</a></span>. Yes, I know that technically I don't count for the &quot;International Skip Of Mystery&quot; mystery achievement, but English isn't my main language so that sorta counts. For the explanation about the &quot;Certificate Of Attendance&quot;, which requires for me to add to a Collaborative Log, I was the one who created the two reimaginings of two of the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-proposal">Roget</a> <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/roget-s-conspiracy-theory-for-scp-001">Proposals</a> in the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/abridged-retirement-proposals">Abridged Retirement Proposals</a> during its drafting phase, so that also technically counts.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div style="float: center; border: solid 4px #BB0011; width: auto; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top:1em; margin-bottom:1em; box-shadow: 2px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <blockquote> <p>&quot;im gonna separate you from your family&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1802367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="stephlynch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1802367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stephlynch" >stephlynch</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;𝔩𝐎ØⓀ 𝓲ή Δ м𝕚𝐑Ｒ𝓸г&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span> upon being asked to insult me, apparently summing<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-803113-7" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >7</a></sup> Cthulhu</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Hey you little piss baby, you think you're so fucking cool, huh? You think you're so fucking tough? You talk a lot of ~big game~ for someone with such a ~small truck~&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2951719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Tyumen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2951719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tyumen" >Tyumen</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;do you actually write anything, ralliston&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;What the fuck did you just fucking say about me, you little bitch? I’ll have you know I graduated top of my class in the Navy Seals, and I’ve been involved in numerous secret raids on Al-Quaeda, and I have over 300 confirmed kills.<br /> I am trained in gorilla warfare and I’m the top sniper in the entire US armed forces. You are nothing to me but just another target. I will wipe you the fuck out with precision the likes of which has never been seen before on this Earth, mark my fucking words.<br /> You think you can get away with saying that shit to me over the Internet? Think again, fucker. As we speak I am contacting my secret network of spies across the USA and your IP is being traced right now so you better prepare for the storm, maggot. The storm that wipes out the pathetic little thing you call your life. You’re fucking dead, Ralliston. I can be anywhere, anytime, and I can kill you in over seven hundred ways, and that’s just with my bare hands.<br /> Not only am I extensively trained in unarmed combat, but I have access to the entire arsenal of the United States Marine Corps and I will use it to its full extent to wipe your miserable ass off the face of the continent, you little shit. If only you could have known what unholy retribution your little “clever” critique was about to bring down upon you, maybe you would have held your fucking tongue.<br /> But you couldn’t, you didn’t, and now you’re paying the price, you goddamn idiot. I will shit fury all over you and you will drown in it.<br /> You’re fucking dead, Ralliston.&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6501232&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Trymeline" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6501232)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/trymeline" >Trymeline</a></span>, most likely drunkenly</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;can i be your son ralliston&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Who?&quot;<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6760712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="WizzBlizz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6760712)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wizzblizz" >WizzBlizz</a></span></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833422" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Though some may know me by my Discord nickname, Kein - both are fine.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. For some pictures of said girls, please see the 'Cool Stuff!' part of the page.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. For an explanation as to what this is, see the 'Cool Stuff!' part of the page.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. And will most likely by the dumbest I ever will.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. Which failed miserably.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. I should mention here that the best way to content me is through Discord, I go there by Kein#5142.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-803113-7"><a href="javascript:;" >7</a>. Yes, you’ve heard me right - summing.</div> </div> 
