ing Out West)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/let-us-get-murdered">Only God Can Judge Me and More (Let Us Get Murdered)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/golden-dawn">The Moon Is a Dead World (Golden Dawn)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/only-once-away-my-son">Only Once Away My Son</a></li> <li><tt><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-vampyre-of-time-and-memory">Th Vmpr f Tm nd Mmr</a></tt></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/somebody-home">I'll Try Living Like This (Somebody Home)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/likeclockwork">...Like Clockwork</a></li> </ol> </blockquote> <h3><span>Further Reading:</span></h3> <blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3999">SCP-3999</a> by LordStonefish</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3817">SCP-3817</a> by Mendelssohn</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-765">SCP-765</a> by TroyL</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/in-his-own-image-part-6">In His Own Image: Part 6</a> from <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/in-his-own-image">In His Own Image</a> by TroyL</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/portraits-of-your-father">Portraits Of Your Father</a> by thefriendlyvandal</li> </ul> </blockquote> <h3><span>Related Tales:</span></h3> <blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/under-the-whale">Under the Whale</a> by MottHery</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/senses-in-distance">Senses In Distance</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/austinyzhao" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3968381&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606833424" alt="AustinYZhao" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3968381)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/austinyzhao" >AustinYZhao</a></span></li> </ul> </blockquote> <h3><span>Tangentially-Related Reference Materials:</span></h3> <blockquote> <ul> <li><a href="htt