&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-3219:&lt;/strong&gt; This Sour Earth&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Author:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606833425&quot; alt=&quot;The Great Hippo&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo&quot;  &gt;The Great Hippo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Images:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://pxhere.com/en/photo/1389425&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:StateLibQld_1_149791_Family_of_George_and_Ailsa_Green,_ca._1940.jpg&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sylvan_Scene_with_Boat_and_Hanging_Clothes_-_Hippopotamus_Lake_-_Near_Satiri_-_Burkina_Faso.jpg&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:John_og_Lina_Sandvik_med_familie_(24850278741).jpg&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.flickr.com/photos/139701443@N04/25812649910&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://pixabay.com/en/tunnel-industrial-shelter-asphalt-2801762/&quot;&gt;Link&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
